  "notes": "Vietnamese is boundary-matched, so ordinary verbs (giảm, tăng, cấm) are safe and are kept for recall; multi-syllable domain phrases carry the precision. Diacritics follow standard Vietnamese press orthography. Subject nouns (xăng dầu, gạo, lương thực, điện) are deliberately absent, which is why fuel-specific instruments like 'thuế bảo vệ môi trường' appear without their commodity, and 'quỹ bình ổn' without 'giá xăng dầu'."
